---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Inicio
description: "Cuidamos tu mente, preparamos tu cuerpo y damos movimiento a tu bienestar, en cada etapa de tu vida."
---
{% from "macros/ui.njk" import button, sectionHead, pillar, card, quoteCard, ctaBanner, mediaPlaceholder, areaCard, areaListCard, iconCuerpo, iconMente, iconMovimiento %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__grid">
    <div>
      <div class="hero__badge">
        <span class="hero__badge-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="eyebrow hero__eyebrow">Estudio terapéutico holístico</p>
      </div>
      <h1>Tu bienestar,<br>en el centro de todo.</h1>
      <p class="hero__body">Cuidamos tu mente, preparamos tu cuerpo y damos movimiento a tu bienestar</p>
      <p class="hero__body">En cada etapa de tu vida.</p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        {{ button("Conoce Integra", "/metodo/", "primary") }}
        {{ button("Ver servicios", "/#areas-de-trabajo", "secondary") }}
      </div>
      <div class="hero__stats">
        <div class="hero__stat">
          <p class="hero__stat-number">3</p>
          <p class="hero__stat-label">Pilares esenciales</p>
        </div>
        <span class="hero__stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="hero__stat">
          <p class="hero__stat-number">1:1</p>
          <p class="hero__stat-label">Atención consciente</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__media">
      {{ mediaPlaceholder("Fotografía: espacio Integra Studio", "4 / 3") }}
      <div class="hero__media-chip">
        <span class="hero__media-chip-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 17 17" fill="none">
            <path d="M8.33333 16.6667C7.31944 16.5417 6.3125 16.2674 5.3125 15.8438C4.3125 15.4201 3.42014 14.8125 2.63542 14.0208C1.85069 13.2292 1.21528 12.2292 0.729167 11.0208C0.243056 9.8125 0 8.36111 0 6.66667V5.83333H0.833333C1.54167 5.83333 2.27083 5.92361 3.02083 6.10417C3.77083 6.28472 4.47222 6.55556 5.125 6.91667C5.29167 5.72222 5.67014 4.49653 6.26042 3.23958C6.85069 1.98264 7.54167 0.902778 8.33333 0C9.125 0.902778 9.81597 1.98264 10.4062 3.23958C10.9965 4.49653 11.375 5.72222 11.5417 6.91667C12.1944 6.55556 12.8958 6.28472 13.6458 6.10417C14.3958 5.92361 15.125 5.83333 15.8333 5.83333H16.6667V6.66667C16.6667 8.36111 16.4236 9.8125 15.9375 11.0208C15.4514 12.2292 14.816 13.2292 14.0312 14.0208C13.2465 14.8125 12.3576 15.4201 11.3646 15.8438C10.3715 16.2674 9.36111 16.5417 8.33333 16.6667ZM8.29167 14.9583C8.13889 12.6528 7.45486 10.9097 6.23958 9.72917C5.02431 8.54861 3.51389 7.81944 1.70833 7.54167C1.86111 9.91667 2.56597 11.6875 3.82292 12.8542C5.07986 14.0208 6.56944 14.7222 8.29167 14.9583ZM8.33333 9.66667C8.54167 9.36111 8.79514 9.04514 9.09375 8.71875C9.39236 8.39236 9.68056 8.11111 9.95833 7.875C9.93056 7.08333 9.77431 6.25694 9.48958 5.39583C9.20486 4.53472 8.81944 3.69444 8.33333 2.875C7.84722 3.69444 7.46181 4.53472 7.17708 5.39583C6.89236 6.25694 6.73611 7.08333 6.70833 7.875C6.98611 8.11111 7.27778 8.39236 7.58333 8.71875C7.88889 9.04514 8.13889 9.36111 8.33333 9.66667ZM9.95833 14.5833C10.4722 14.4167 11.0069 14.1736 11.5625 13.8542C12.1181 13.5347 12.6354 13.1007 13.1146 12.5521C13.5937 12.0035 14.0035 11.3194 14.3438 10.5C14.684 9.68056 14.8889 8.69444 14.9583 7.54167C13.6528 7.73611 12.5069 8.17014 11.5208 8.84375C10.5347 9.51736 9.77778 10.375 9.25 11.4167C9.41667 11.8611 9.55903 12.3472 9.67708 12.875C9.79514 13.4028 9.88889 13.9722 9.95833 14.5833Z" fill="#7A8F7A"/>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span>Calle Alcorcón 12 · Parla</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container section-head section-head--center-desktop">
    <p class="eyebrow">Filosofía Integra</p>
    <h2>Todo está conectado.</h2>
    <p class="section-head__body">Todo está conectado y lo que sentimos, cómo vivimos nuestro día a día y cómo nos movemos forma parte de nuestro bienestar. Por eso te acompañamos desde una misma mirada, teniendo en cuenta lo que necesitas en cada momento.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="concept-graphic">
      <div class="concept-graphic__simple">
        <span>Cuerpo</span>
        <span class="concept-graphic__divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Mente</span>
        <span class="concept-graphic__divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Movimiento</span>
      </div>

